# Ocean Escape

## Project Type

Create a polished 2D horizontal side-scrolling endless runner game using Flutter and Flame.

The game should be designed primarily for Android mobile devices, with an architecture that can later support Windows and Web.

The game must feel like a real casual mobile game rather than a prototype.

The game should be colorful, smooth, cute, responsive, lightweight, offline-friendly, and optimized for mid-range Android devices.

The visual style should be polished cartoon 2D with bright colors, expressive characters, smooth animations, layered parallax backgrounds, particle effects, satisfying sound effects, and responsive controls.

---

# 1. Game Concept

Game name:

Ocean Escape

Core concept:

The player controls a cute small fish swimming continuously from left to right through an endless underwater world.

The fish remains approximately on the left-middle portion of the screen while the underwater environment, obstacles, collectibles, and scenery move from right to left.

The player must control the fish vertically.

Tap the screen to make the fish swim upward.

When the player stops tapping, the fish naturally sinks because of gravity.

The player must avoid dangerous obstacles and collect valuable items while trying to survive for as long as possible.

The game continues becoming faster and more difficult over time.

The goal is to achieve the highest possible score.

